hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15523","Rawh narrated to us: Ibn Jurayj narrated to us, he said: Amr ibn Dinar informed me that Abu al-Minhal informed him that Iyas ibn Abd, of the Companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), said: Do not sell surplus water, for the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) forbade selling water, he said: And the people were selling the water of the Euphrates, so he forbade them."
